ect's app to see a change working. Use when asked to run, start, or screenshot the app, or to confirm a change works in the real app (not just tests). First looks for a project skill that already covers launching the app; otherwise falls back to built-in patterns per project type (CLI, server, TUI, Electron, browser-driven, library).\n- init\n- security-review","skillCount":126,"isInitial":true,"names":["agent-session-backup","agents-sdk","anime-hardsub-hevc","archive-organize","claude-md-global","cloudflare","cloudflare-email-service","cloudflare-one","cloudflare-one-migrations","creative-engine","ctrl-s","debug-par-la-preuve","design-ux-ui-curves-liquidglass","durable-objects","edit-text","everyday-proof","feedback","feedback-stack","ffmpeg-hardware-check","finish-work-protocol","first-movement","gear","hatch-pet","imagegen-precise-compositing","interview-audio","japanese-context","juice-it","kanji-stroke-order","kanji-stroke-order-html","kanji-stroke-order-svg","karpathy-guidelines","masterclass-builder","matthieu-context","memory-context","mocap-take-from-youtube","plan-then-execute","product-research","progress","prompt-components-houdini","prompt-stacking","recap-simple","recit-francais","reduce-echo","resonance-sm66-patch","sandbox-sdk","sante-sport-alimentation","series-frame-references","session","skill-sync","socrate","srt-yt-anime","stop-first","tasks-sequence","think-of-everything","translate-srt-selectlanguage","turnstile-spin","ui-atlas","ui-espacement-gestalt","video-frames-extract","wait-validation","web-perf","workers-best-practices","wrangler","ytb-dlp","zenray-assets","zenray-assets-upload","zenray-backup-mirror","zenray-cloud","zenray-collect","zenray-create-audio","zenray-houdini","zenray-houdini-generate-isolated-components","zenray-houdini-height-loop","zenray-houdini-materials-identification","zenray-houdini-prompt-components-grey-mesh","zenray-houdini-prompt-materials-breakdown","zenray-houdini-texture-designer","zenray-html-photoshop-pdf-hd